le functionality\n  - Create notification preferences UI\n  - Implement language selection\n\n#### Task 4.7: State Management & API Integration\n- **Assigned Specialist:** Frontend Developer\n- **Duration:** 4 days\n- **Deliverables:**\n  - Redux/Context API implementation\n  - API service layer\n  - Data fetching logic\n  - Error handling\n- **Key Activities:**\n  - Set up state management (Redux or Context API)\n  - Create API client with axios/fetch\n  - Implement error boundary components\n  - Add loading states and spinners\n  - Implement data caching on frontend\n  - Create error handling and retry logic\n\n#### Task 4.8: Authentication UI Implementation\n- **Assigned Specialist:** Frontend Developer\n- **Duration:** 2 days\n- **Deliverables:**\n  - Login page\n  - Registration page\n  - Password reset flow\n  - OAuth integration UI\n- **Key Activities:**\n  - Create login form with validation\n  - Create registration form\n  - Implement password reset flow\n  - Add OAuth provider buttons\n  - Implement form validation and error messages\n\n#### Task 4.9: Performance Optimization\n- **Assigned Specialist:** Frontend Developer / Performance Engineer\n- **Duration:** 3 days\n- **Deliverables:**\n  - Code splitting implementation\n  - Lazy loading setup\n  - Image optimization\n  - Performance metrics report\n- **Key Activities:**\n  - Implement code splitting for routes\n  - Set up lazy loading for components\n  - Optimize images and assets\n  - Implement service workers for offline support\n  - Measure and optimize Core Web Vitals\n  - Implement caching strategies\n\n#### Task 4.10: Frontend Testing\n- **Assigned Specialist:** Frontend Developer / QA Engineer\n- **Duration:** 3 days\n- **Deliverables:**"}], "tool_failures": []}J&
